.An Daniel Cristian Cruz
.Sh CAVEATS
The module set is not hashed into
.Va planDigest .
For a specification a binary can plan at all the module set does not change a
single statement, and one it cannot plan is refused outright -- so hashing it
would change every existing digest while protecting nothing.
.Pp
A distribution is reversed with
.Cm citus_undistribute_table
in a later specification, not by reverting one.
Like any kind that moves data, the plan says what it copies and where.
